Write a C program using the functionvoid climb(intstep_arr[], int 
reachable[]); which reads the number of steps taken by a person on each 
jump while climbing a staircase in an array. Compute and print all the step 
numbers traversed from ground level (step 0). 
Input: 
No. of jumps: 
6 
Number of steps in each jump: 
2 1 3 1 2 2 
Step Numbers Traversed: 
2 3 6 7 9 11 
ANSWER 
#include <stdio.h> 

void climb(int step_arr[], int reachable[]) { 
 int i, sum = 0; 
 reachable[0] = 1; 

 for (i = 0; step_arr[i] != 0; i++) { 
 sum += step_arr[i]; 
 reachable[sum] = 1; 
 } 
} 

